        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The best part of the day is when you get home, kick off your shoes and get comfortable. We looked for the softest, fuzziest slide we could find and built our little store around it. We're a small team, we answer every email ourselves, and we'll always tell you honestly how long shipping takes.</p>"
